# Claude Code writes many files into this folder, and some hold secrets or keys.
# So this file works the other way round: ignore EVERYTHING, then allow back only the
# few files that belong in the repository. A new Claude Code version can add a new
# secret file, and that file stays ignored by default.

*
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!MANIFEST.md
!settings.json

# Hand-installed skills (the account-synced ones stay ignored)
!skills/
skills/*
!skills/asd-ste100/
!skills/llm-council/
!skills/asd-ste100/**
!skills/daily-content/
!skills/daily-content/**
!skills/llm-council/**

# Memory: the rule files, but NOT the conversation transcripts next to them
!projects/
projects/*
!projects/-home-msohail22/
projects/-home-msohail22/*
!projects/-home-msohail22/memory/
!projects/-home-msohail22/memory/**
